{"server":"cn","storyId":"act22side_level_act22side_01_end","groupId":"act22side","stageId":"act22side_01","title":"逃离与追逐","storyCode":"FC-1","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"d46a46e9cd89af110e31c5943f3b850b1c4b34c47a641662cea01a70d074a5fc","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在死去的深池士兵身上，风笛认出了自己在小丘郡见过的法术。在维恩的恳求下，苇草同意护送这群塔拉人逃避追捕。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g3_swamp_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些士兵是怎么回事啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒下之前没有什么像样的抵抗，对我们的喊话也没反应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们已经死了。死亡时间......超过四十八小时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈陈，我知道你是警察，你的判断不会出错。可是，这些人在被我们击倒之前，明明都是站着的啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在整合运动的队伍中见过一种能操纵他人的源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但二者甚至谈不上相似。如果阿米娅......如果罗德岛的卡特斯在，她也许能比我更清楚地感觉到那种差别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那种源石技艺否认情感和思绪，将活着的萨卡兹战士磨成行走的兵器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而这里的深池士兵，他们确实已经死了......只是强烈的情感在他们死后仍然燃烧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"燃烧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一种感觉而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这种源石技艺有具体的模样，如果我要用我的赤霄去切开它，我会想象自己要斩断的是一团火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我见过......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_I5"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紫火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪的紫火，在死去的战士眼睛里燃烧着......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g3_swamp_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在小丘郡见过你描述的这种源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一路上......一路上我都没有再见过！陈陈，我们真的快追上了，是不是？那个在小丘郡带领鬼魂部队的术师，就在这附近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会忘了她的样子......只要再见到她，我一定能认出来，到那时候，我就能得到深池的真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那快走吧！多找点人问问路，村民，或者路过的商队......我们总能找到他们的，反正他们又不是真正的鬼魂！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巡逻队来得也太突然了，还好咱们眼力好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，那些维多利亚的混蛋，来抓人难道还会提前打招呼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们先走，我清点一下人数。刚刚逃得那么着急，我总担心有人掉队......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，对了！医生呢？没人去叫上她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不是说今天早上就自己离开吗？管她干嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说，就算她被维多利亚士兵抓了，应该也不会出事吧？她又不在通缉令上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，她在呀！昨晚咱们就把她给卷进来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然天黑了些，当兵的可能没看清她的脸，但这一带你见过几个瓦伊凡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又没本事帮忙，一天到晚替别人操心，有什么用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，不对，凯莉在这里......塞尔蒙，你是故意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你骗她说我们有同伴不见了，求她帮忙去找找人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？她那么好心，救了我们，还分了我们一些药......你就这么把她留给那些当兵的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这还用问？把她留在后面吸引注意力，我们就能安全地逃跑一段时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且她就算被抓，也说不出什么重要的事。她甚至根本不知道我们朝哪个方向走了，更不知道我们是要去找深池的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......可她会死呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，她自己走，迟早也会撞上巡逻队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我们之前就该把她的行李全抢走，至少别让那些东西落到维多利亚的混蛋手里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是她自己选的，维恩。你没注意到她看我的表情吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她很熟悉深池，却没有表现出对深池的善意。她还讲标准的维多利亚语。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种人比真正的维多利亚人还恨我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不信，塞尔蒙。我还是信我看人的直觉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"别紧张，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的情况，我并不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。你不是深池的同伴，只是一时慌张，与那些叛乱分子混在了一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"（塔拉语）你杀过深池。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"你听懂了，那我们没有认错。这一带很少有会塔拉语的瓦伊凡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天晚上，那个深池士兵把你们带去了哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......他们不是深池，跟深池也没有关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也从来没有杀死过深池的人，是你们弄错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以坦诚一点，不用担心会被报复。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"附近的土地都在驻军的严密监控之下，特伦特侯爵绝不会像某些贵族一样碌碌无为，放任深池四处煽风点火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"这也是为什么我们能认出你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"前几天，特伦特郡航道附近另一聚落的居民，向驻军处报告了深池的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"但那几名深池士兵在袭击聚落之前，就被一名白发的瓦伊凡打倒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可以进一步沟通吗？关于你的身份、动机，以及昨晚那场与深池手法类似的纵火......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"——站住！你想逃跑吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"拦住她！这个瓦伊凡害怕做记录，肯定也有问题！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"——刀、刀断了？哪里来的力气......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能说的，我已经全部告诉你们了，让我离开吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样对我们都好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你这么护着那些混账，看来你跟他们也是一伙的，都是自以为是的塔拉渣滓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"射击！几支箭杀不死一个瓦伊凡，先控制住再说！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......为什么这样恨他们？你自己，明明也是塔拉人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴！不许——用那个词叫我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"......从小说着塔拉语的就是塔拉人？我小时候根本没听过“塔拉人”这个词！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"要是那个击退深池的人真的是你，你就该看清楚“塔拉人”只是这帮匪徒破坏秩序的借口，然后跟他们划清界限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“塔拉人被维多利亚的虚荣风气侵蚀，才导致许多人堕落成了匪徒。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......很多年前，一位老师告诉我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈......你在收手。你甚至害怕自己的长枪会刺到别人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"——你竟然敢看不起我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"因为，只要一瞬间，他们就会变成荒野上的灰烬。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“领袖”","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，拉芙希妮。要让你做的事情不被发现，最好的方法就是清除所有目击者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，我不会那么做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"队长！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻队士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"先......带着队长撤退！向上级报告，请求支援！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，他们一定，追不上我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很快就会从这里离开。维多利亚军队的调动速度，我很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这么做，绝不是错的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她警觉地刺出长枪。\n——枪尖悬停在灌木丛前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灌木后的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我，是我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是我，我不害你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g6_noblelivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我很清楚，特伦特郡不至于为了这样一笔订单更改自己的航道，所以我方愿意推后交付日期，等待移动城市靠近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，只有皇家级矿场能够提供如此高纯度的源石燃料，因此我也十分感激特伦特侯爵表现出的友善态度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对于这次商业合作，我想我们都很满意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......现在您的秘书带着签署好的合同离开了，休斯先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"他会先一步回办公室，请相信他能处理好这份重要的合同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我没有怀疑他办事能力的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，这也意味着您还有比合同更重要的事情要亲自跟我谈，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟您特意选了这么一处僻静旧宅，还支开了佣人们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，您当然会想到，哈哈。从一开始我做此布置，就是有意让您了解我的诚意。我希望......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"......接下来的对话，可以建立在我们都曾经在近卫学校念书的情分上，洛——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你竟然记得那个名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......那位毕竟是舞会上的名人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，那样的人，喝醉酒在什么地方跌倒，然后就再也没爬起来，不是挺合理的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我相信绝大多数人都已经把她忘记了。无论是真的事故，还是背后有人安排，大家都知道别去探头探脑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"......多谢你这么捧场地佯装惊讶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的惊讶可是有一点真心实意在里面的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提起一个从学校里消失、现在也不存在于维多利亚任何一份档案上的名字......多容易招来“鬼魂”呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你说得对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"就让我开诚布公地说吧，你为什么要主动联络我？我只是一个与各界商人往来的小贵族，对于你所暗示的信息，我什么都做不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"间谍小姐，你是想通过我绕开上面的某些人，以此满足自己膨胀的野心，还是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你既然已经把话听明白了，再装傻可就显得不讨人喜欢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不过是看在我们都曾就读于近卫学校的分上，特意来给你......还有那两位一路寻找鬼魂部队的人，稍微提个醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我当然知道她们来找过你，而且，你帮她们追查了一批半年前运往小丘郡的源石制品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对于有些人来说，你说出去的事情太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白你的身份有多敏感，你的责任又有多重。请放心，这一机密信息我绝不会透露给任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我那两位冒失的同学，我会委婉地提醒她们适可而止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次订单的去向，我会给你的人留下一点调查的线索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢你的好意，不过以我小小商人的身份，恐怕不该知道太多事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，请不要这么谦虚。毕竟，您可是商业联盟的副主席，您背后的那位伯爵，应该很在乎您在生意中收集到的情报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位至今沉默不语的铁公爵究竟是否值得投靠？他也差不多是时候选择自己的立场了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"阿赫茉妮，你难道不是维多利亚的......不，你究竟是为谁效力——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——休斯先生，我们之间的下一份合同会是什么内容......我很乐意早日收到您的消息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，对不起......我真不是来害你的，别动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，刚刚我实在不敢出来，也没有帮上你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在说什么呢，你的长枪用得那么好，两下就把士兵都打昏了，根本用不着别人帮忙，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们应该已经撤离了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......唉，是，你都猜到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，你也被他们留下来了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们应该不敢才对。你不会战斗，一定会被抓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你是这一带的商贩，认识很多人，如果他们对你不义，你有太多报复的手段可用......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，没有。我其实......是想赶回来叫上你，跟我们一起逃跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，来得晚了点。我又愧疚，又怕跑回来撞上当兵的，想来想去，就来晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好，你能打，当兵的拿你没办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃，女士，你......您说说话呀。您真让我害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？......为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我实在是不知道怎么向你道歉，才能让你心里好受一点。真的，他们平时都挺好心的，只是这些日子把人都逼疯了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用说了......没关系的，我不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像......就像路边丛生的苇草。"},{"type":"narration","text":"不会毒死你，也不会压垮你，最多只会让你感觉到刺痒一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么小的谎言，谁会去在乎呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你的伤心都写在脸上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......看起来很伤心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的话，不用担心，但是，你们赶快逃吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨晚的火灾之后，军队一定会从城市里调来更多人手，搜索这片荒野。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，好，当然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，其实还有一件事，我不太好开口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫我们逃，我们当然也知道。可是十几天了，我们就像猎场里的野兽似的，被当兵的追来追去，一直在荒原上打转，就是逃不掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我想再求你一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"求你帮帮我们，护送我们一程，让我们搭上逃命的运载车。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
